erature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11508165521824613, "compression_ratio": 1.481012658227848, "no_speech_prob": 0.02048012986779213}, {"id": 41, "seek": 16802, "start": 168.86, "end": 175.02, "text": " If you are happy, you are going to attract other happy people to you.", "tokens": [50405, 1002, 345, 389, 3772, 11, 345, 389, 1016, 284, 4729, 584, 3772, 661, 284, 345, 13, 50713], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15900319198082233, "compression_ratio": 1.640625, "no_speech_prob": 0.019877735525369644}, {"id": 42, "seek": 16802, "start": 175.02, "end": 180.3, "text": " Tuesday, fitting in is way overrated.", "tokens": [50713, 3431, 11, 15830, 287, 318, 835, 625, 4111, 13, 50977], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15900319198082233, "compression_ratio": 1.640625, "no_speech_prob": 0.019877735525369644}, {"id": 43, "seek": 16802, "start": 180.3, "end": 185.54000000000002, "text": " I spent a whole lot of my life trying to be myself and at the same time fit in.", "tokens": [50977, 314, 3377, 257, 2187, 1256, 286, 616, 1204, 2111, 284, 307, 3589, 290, 379, 262, 976, 640, 4197, 287, 13, 51239], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15900319198082233, "compression_ratio": 1.640625, "no_speech_prob": 0.019877735525369644}, {"id": 44, "seek": 16802, "start": 185.54000000000002, "end": 187.62, "text": " Just be who you are.", "tokens": [51239, 2329, 307, 508, 345, 389, 13, 51343], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15900319198082233, "compression_ratio": 1.640625, "no_speech_prob": 0.019877735525369644}, {"id": 45, "seek": 16802, "start": 187.62, "end": 192.82000000000002, "text": " If you are surrounding yourself with the right people, they will not only get it, they will", "tokens": [51343, 1002, 345, 389, 7346, 3511, 351, 262, 826, 661, 11, 484, 481, 407, 691, 651, 340, 11, 484, 481, 51603], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15900319198082233, "compression_ratio": 1.640625, "no_speech_prob": 0.019877735525369644}, {"id": 46, "seek": 16802, "start": 192.82000000000002, "end": 194.94, "text": " appreciate it.", "tokens": [51603, 9144, 340, 13, 51709], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15900319198082233, "compression_ratio": 1.640625, "no_speech_prob": 0.019877735525369644}, {"id": 47, "seek": 19494, "start": 195.5, "end": 198.85999999999999, "text": " Wednesday, embrace your inner child.", "tokens": [50391, 3583, 11, 12553, 534, 8434, 1200, 13, 50559], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1611321965853373, "compression_ratio": 1.658878504672897, "no_speech_prob": 0.004913574084639549}, {"id": 48, "seek": 19494, "start": 198.85999999999999, "end": 204.34, "text": " Sometimes people tell me that I look like I'm playing dress up or that I remind them", "tokens": [50559, 8975, 661, 1560, 502, 326, 314, 804, 588, 314, 1101, 2712, 6576, 510, 393, 326, 314, 7101, 606, 50833], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1611321965853373, "compression_ratio": 1.658878504672897, "no_speech_prob": 0.004913574084639549}, {"id": 49, "seek": 19494, "start": 204.34, "end": 206.7, "text": " of their seven-year-old.", "tokens": [50833, 286, 511, 3598, 12, 1941, 12, 727, 13, 50951], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1611321965853373, "compression_ratio": 1.658878504672897, "no_speech_prob": 0.004913574084639549}, {"id": 50, "seek": 19494, "start": 206.7, "end": 211.42, "text": " I like to smile and say thank you.", "tokens": [50951, 314, 588, 284, 8212, 290, 910, 5875, 345, 13, 51187], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1611321965853373, "compression_ratio": 1.658878504672897, "no_speech_prob": 0.004913574084639549}, {"id": 51, "seek": 19494, "start": 211.42, "end": 214.76, "text": " Thursday, confidence is key.", "tokens": [51187, 3635, 11, 6628, 318, 1994, 13, 51354], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1611321965853373, "compression_ratio": 1.658878504672897, "no_speech_prob": 0.004913574084639549}, {"id": 52, "seek": 19494, "start": 214.76, "end": 219.16, "text": " If you think you look good in something, you almost certainly do.", "tokens": [51354, 1002, 345, 892, 345, 804, 922, 287, 1223, 11, 345, 2048, 3729, 466, 13, 51574], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1611321965853373, "compression_ratio": 1.658878504672897, "no_speech_prob": 0.004913574084639549}, {"id": 53, "seek": 19494, "start": 219.16, "end": 223.34, "text": " And if you don't think you look good in something, you're also probably right.", "tokens": [51574, 843, 611, 345, 836, 470, 892, 345, 804, 922, 287, 1223, 11, 345, 821, 635, 2192, 826, 13, 51783], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1611321965853373, "compression_ratio": 1.658878504672897, "no_speech_prob": 0.004913574084639549}, {"id": 54, "seek": 22334, "start": 223.34, "end": 226.62, "text": " I grew up with a mom who taught me this day in and day out.", "tokens": [50363, 314, 6348, 510, 351, 257, 1995, 508, 7817, 502, 428, 1110, 287, 290, 1110, 503, 13, 50527], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16220986641059487, "compression_ratio": 1.573643410852713, "no_speech_prob": 0.0009072558605112135}, {"id": 55, "seek": 22334, "start": 226.62, "end": 230.74, "text": " But it wasn't until I turned 30 that I really got what this meant.", "tokens": [50527, 887, 340, 2492, 470, 1566, 314, 2900, 1542, 326, 314, 1107, 1392, 644, 428, 4001, 13, 50733], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16220986641059487, "compression_ratio": 1.573643410852713, "no_speech_prob": 0.0009072558605112135}, {"id": 56, "seek": 22334, "start": 230.74, "end": 234.18, "text": " And I'm going to break it down for you for just a second.", "tokens": [50733, 843, 314, 1101, 1016, 284, 2270, 340, 866, 329, 345, 329, 655, 257, 1218, 13, 50905], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16220986641059487, "compression_ratio": 1.573643410852713, "no_speech_prob": 0.0009072558605112135}, {"id": 57, "seek": 22334, "start": 234.18, "end": 240.98000000000002, "text": " If you believe you're a beautiful person, inside and out, there is no look that you", "tokens": [50905, 1002, 345, 1975, 345, 821, 257, 4950, 1048, 11, 2641, 290, 503, 11, 612, 318, 645, 804, 326, 345, 51245], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16220986641059487, "compression_ratio": 1.573643410852713, "no_speech_prob": 0.0009072558605112135}, {"id": 58, "seek": 22334, "start": 240.98000000000002, "end": 242.42000000000002, "text": " can't pull off.", "tokens": [51245, 460, 470, 2834, 572, 13, 51317], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16220986641059487, "compression_ratio": 1.573643410852713, "no_speech_prob": 0.0009072558605112135}, {"id": 59, "seek": 22334, "start": 242.42000000000002, "end": 245.06, "text": " So there is no excuse for any of us here in this audience.", "tokens": [51317, 1406, 612, 318, 645, 12226, 329, 597, 286, 514, 994, 287, 428, 5386, 13, 51449], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16220986641059487, "compression_ratio": 1.573643410852713, "no_speech_prob": 0.0009072558605112135}, {"id": 60, "seek": 22334, "start": 245.06, "end": 247.74, "text": " We should be able to rock anything we want to rock.", "tokens": [51449, 775, 815, 307, 1498, 284, 3881, 1997, 356, 765, 284, 3881, 13, 51583], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16220986641059487, "compression_ratio": 1.573643410852713, "no_speech_prob": 0.0009072558605112135}, {"id": 61, "seek": 22334, "start": 247.74, "end": 249.58, "text": " Thank you.", "tokens": [51583, 6952, 345, 13, 51675], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16220986641059487, "compression_ratio": 1.573643410852713, "no_speech_prob": 0.0009072558605112135}, {"id": 62, "seek": 24958, "start": 249.58, "end": 260.94, "text": " Friday, a universal truth, five words for you, gold sequins go with everything.", "tokens": [50363, 3217, 11, 257, 10112, 3872, 11, 1936, 2456, 329, 345, 11, 3869, 4726, 1040, 467, 351, 2279, 13, 50931], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1151873270670573, "compression_ratio": 1.5877551020408163, "no_speech_prob": 0.012533663772046566}, {"id": 63, "seek": 24958, "start": 260.94, "end": 267.26, "text": " And finally, Saturday, developing your own unique personal style is a really great way", "tokens": [50931, 843, 3443, 11, 3909, 11, 5922, 534, 898, 3748, 2614, 3918, 318, 257, 1107, 1049, 835, 51247], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1151873270670573, "compression_ratio": 1.5877551020408163, "no_speech_prob": 0.012533663772046566}, {"id": 64, "seek": 24958, "start": 267.26, "end": 271.22, "text": " to tell the world something about you without having to say a word.", "tokens": [51247, 284, 1560, 262, 995, 1223, 546, 345, 1231, 1719, 284, 910, 257, 1573, 13, 51445], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1151873270670573, "compression_ratio": 1.5877551020408163, "no_speech_prob": 0.012533663772046566}, {"id": 65, "seek": 24958, "start": 271.22, "end": 275.06, "text": " It's been proven to me time and time again as people have walked up to me this week simply", "tokens": [51445, 632, 338, 587, 9157, 284, 502, 640, 290, 640, 757, 355, 661, 423, 6807, 510, 284, 502, 428, 1285, 2391, 51637], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1151873270670573, "compression_ratio": 1.5877551020408163, "no_speech_prob": 0.012533663772046566}, {"id": 66, "seek": 24958, "start": 275.06, "end": 276.94, "text": " because of what I'm wearing.", "tokens": [51637, 780, 286, 644, 314, 1101, 5762, 13, 51731], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1151873270670573, "compression_ratio": 1.5877551020408163, "no_speech_prob": 0.012533663772046566}, {"id": 67, "seek": 24958, "start": 276.94, "end": 279.12, "text": " And we've had great conversations.", "tokens": [51731, 843, 356, 1053, 550, 1049, 10275, 13, 51840], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1151873270670573, "compression_ratio": 1.5877551020408163, "no_speech_prob": 0.012533663772046566}, {"id": 68, "seek": 27912, "start": 279.12, "end": 283.18, "text": " So obviously this is not all going to fit back in my tiny suitcase.", "tokens": [50363, 1406, 6189, 428, 318, 407, 477, 1016, 284, 4197, 736, 287, 616, 7009, 45391, 13, 50566], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10658922107941514, "compression_ratio": 1.6415094339622642, "no_speech_prob": 0.046248339116573334}, {"id": 69, "seek": 27912, "start": 283.18, "end": 287.92, "text": " So before I go home to Brooklyn, I'm going to donate everything back because the lesson", "tokens": [50566, 1406, 878, 314, 467, 1363, 284, 12232, 11, 314, 1101, 1016, 284, 16565, 2279, 736, 780, 262, 11483, 50803], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10658922107941514, "compression_ratio": 1.6415094339622642, "no_speech_prob": 0.046248339116573334}, {"id": 70, "seek": 27912, "start": 287.92, "end": 292.44, "text": " I'm trying to learn myself this week is that it's okay to let go.", "tokens": [50803, 314, 1101, 2111, 284, 2193, 3589, 428, 1285, 318, 326, 340, 338, 8788, 284, 1309, 467, 13, 51029], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10658922107941514, "compression_ratio": 1.6415094339622642, "no_speech_prob": 0.046248339116573334}, {"id": 71, "seek": 27912, "start": 292.44, "end": 297.44, "text": " I don't need to get emotionally attached to these things because around the corner, there's", "tokens": [51029, 314, 836, 470, 761, 284, 651, 17991, 7223, 284, 777, 1243, 780, 1088, 262, 5228, 11, 612, 338, 51279], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10658922107941514, "compression_ratio": 1.6415094339622642, "no_speech_prob": 0.046248339116573334}, {"id": 72, "seek": 27912, "start": 297.44, "end": 304.88, "text": " always going to be another crazy, colorful, shiny outfit just waiting for me if I put", "tokens": [51279, 1464, 1016, 284, 307, 1194, 7165, 11, 20239, 11, 22441, 16313, 655, 4953, 329, 502, 611, 314, 1234, 51651], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10658922107941514, "compression_ratio": 1.6415094339622642, "no_speech_prob": 0.046248339116573334}, {"id": 73, "seek": 27912, "start": 304.88, "end": 307.88, "text": " a little love in my heart and look.", "tokens": [51651, 257, 1310, 1842, 287, 616, 2612, 290, 804, 13, 51801], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10658922107941514, "compression_ratio": 1.6415094339622642, "no_speech_prob": 0.046248339116573334}, {"id": 74, "seek": 30788, "start": 307.88, "end": 308.88, "text": " Thank you very much.", "tokens": [50363, 6952, 345, 845, 881, 13, 50413], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.44071054458618164, "compression_ratio": 0.9393939393939394, "no_speech_prob": 0.4030817747116089}, {"id": 75, "seek": 30788, "start": 308.88, "end": 308.9, "text": " Thank you.", "tokens": [50413, 6952, 345, 13, 50414], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.44071054458618164, "compression_ratio": 0.9393939393939394, "no_speech_prob": 0.4030817747116089}], "language": "en"}